{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Do not fear, Abram.</b> Do not fear that the four kings will take vengeance upon you." "<b>Your reward.</b> It is not enough that your merits were not diminished on account of what I delivered you through; but in addition, there is reward for this deed of yours, in that you showed kindness to your kin and others to rescue the spoils from the hand of oppressors." "<b>Greatly.</b> In this world." "<b>Exceedingly.</b> For the life of the world to come, as the Sages said: things whose fruits a person enjoys in this world while the principal endures for him for the world to come — among them is the practice of kindness (Pe'ah 1:1)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:09.577438821Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}